#, no-wrap
msgid "Scope"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item       | Description                                              |\n"
"| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Platform   | **Android only** sideload (APK); iOS later               |\n"
"| UI         | bootstrap → Hub `/web/*`（与浏览器/PWA 同一产物）        |\n"
"| Modules    | Chat + Console（Hub 托管 shell-ui）                      |\n"
"| Hub config | APP **Hub settings**（Preferences）或 bootstrap 首次配置 |\n"
"| Hub duties | Hub RPC REST `/hub/rpc/v1` + WebSocket at `/hub/rpc/v1`  |\n"
msgstr ""

