#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:51
msgid ""
"Non-loopback Hub URL requires token; REST uses `Authorization: Bearer`; SAP "
"sends `auth_token` in `connect` frame."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                                | Common cause                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |\n"
"| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Keyboard covers chat input             | WebView not resizing; need `adjustResize` + `@capacitor/keyboard`; `cap sync` after Web changes                                                                                                                                 |\n"
"| Chat input unresponsive                | No selected conversation (first install should auto-create); or SAP disconnected                                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| Console load failed / Failed to fetch  | Hub not `--host 0.0.0.0`, wrong token, firewall; Chrome Remote Debugging for Bearer header                                                                                                                                      |\n"
"| 测试连接「网络错误」、浏览器同地址正常 | Bootstrap 在 `https://localhost`，WebView 会拦截跨域/混合内容 fetch；需 **Capacitor 原生 HTTP**（`CapacitorHttp`）或先 HTTP 进 Hub 再测。HTTPS 另需 APK 信任用户 CA（`network_security_config` + 安装 `rootCA.pem` 后重装 APK） |\n"
"| ZeroTier / 虚拟网卡 IP                 | 确认手机 ZeroTier 在线；Hub `http.host: 0.0.0.0`；`allowed_hosts` 含该 IP；壳层 Hub URL **勿带尾斜杠**，HTTP 用 `:2658`                                                                                                         |\n"
"| Not Found                              | Avoid legacy paths like `/console`/dashboard/index.html`; use SPA `/web/console/dashboard`                                                                                                                                      |\n"
"| TTS / 朗读无声                         | 默认 Edge TTS 需 Hub 出网；Hub 设置 → 语音 → 试听。若用 Web Speech 需 HTTPS 安全上下文                                                                                                                                          |\n"
"| Mobile UI 与浏览器不一致               | 确认 WebView 地址为 `{hub}/web/*`（非 `https://localhost`）；Hub 需部署最新 `build:web`                                                                                                                                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:68
msgid "Settings → **Debug** (desktop and mobile share shell-ui panel):"
msgstr ""

