#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs desktop shell"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|              | Electron `src/app/shell/desktop`                | Capacitor `src/app/shell/mobile`             |\n"
"| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Injection    | preload → `window.satelliteShell`               | Hub SPA `bootstrap-capacitor` → API          |\n"
"| Hub config   | Hub settings → `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` | bootstrap / Hub settings → Preferences       |\n"
"| Debug/Sentry | Settings → Debug → same file `debug`            | Settings → Debug → Preferences               |\n"
"| REST         | Direct `hubUrl/hub/rpc/v1/*` (Bearer)           | Direct `hubUrl/hub/rpc/v1/*` (CORS + Bearer) |\n"
"| instance_id  | File `~/.anima/satellites/chat/`                | Preferences                                  |\n"
"| Content      | chat + admin + companion                        | chat + admin（Hub `/web/*`）                 |\n"
msgstr ""
